    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50497" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">verbālis</span></b> , e, adj.
		verbum, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>consisting of words</i>, <i>wordy</i>, <i>verbal.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen. (postclass.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">horrea,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Fulg. Myth. 1 praef.</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">undae mulierum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib.</span></i>
			—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In
			partic., in gram., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to verbs</i>, <i>verbal</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Charis. p. 128</span></i> P.;
					<i><span class="en">Diom. p. 310</span></i> ib.</div>
